  "description": "CR 702.145b by day the same spell enters front face up",
  "note": "The negative of CR 701.27j through CR 702.145b's first static ability (\"if it is night ... it enters transformed\"): by day its condition fails and Infestation Expert enters front face up and stays there. The falsifier for a rewrite that applied on every entry; daytime/cr-701-27j-702-145b-and-the-transformed-permanent-s-own is the night leg, whose only difference is that bob casts nothing. The face is read with the Expert's enters trigger still on the stack, before anything else could turn it, and the front face's trigger then makes one Insect, not the back face's two. Day comes from Tovolar at the first settle (CR 702.145d) on bob's turn, and bob casts a Fog so alice's untap step leaves it day (CR 502.2); Tovolar is there only to give the game a designation at all. Five Forests pay the {4}{G} without a decision.",
